; A frame's filter from its two targets. Three cards a frame in (a, b, u); it asks the host for filter a (OUT at
; aska, cards at INP ga) and filter b (OUT at askb, cards at INP gb), eleven cards each: K10..K1 and the gain G. Out,
; each of the eleven blended, (x (10 - u) + y u) / 10: the Ks to the glide machine, G to the level (OUT at og).
; The blend runs 10 - u ADDs of x and u ADDs of y in two rows, each entered by a jump set once a frame, then SFT 01.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            frm     INP   a        03-15: a frame: the jumps into the rows, and the two filters
  04                    INP   b
  05                    INP   u
  06                    CLA   cxr
  07                    ADD   u
  08                    STO   jx
  09                    CLA   csf
  10                    SUB   u
  11                    STO   jy
  12            aska    OUT   a
  13            askb    OUT   b
  14                    CLA   n9
  15                    STO   i
  16            lp      INP   tx       16-25: the ten Ks
  17            gb      INP   ty
  18                    JMP   bl
  19                    STO   k
  20                    OUT   k
  21                    CLA   i
  22                    SUB   00
  23                    STO   i
  24                    TAC   gg
  25                    JMP   lp
  26            gg      INP   tx       26-31: G
  27            gb2     INP   ty
  28                    JMP   bl
  29                    STO   k
  30            og      OUT   k
  31                    JMP   frm
  32            bl      CLA   99       32-58: (tx (10 - u) + ty u) / 10
  33                    STO   bret
  34                    CLA   z
  35            jx      DATA  0        (JMP xrow + u)
  36            xrow    ADD   tx
  37                    ADD   tx
  38                    ADD   tx
  39                    ADD   tx
  40                    ADD   tx
  41                    ADD   tx
  42                    ADD   tx
  43                    ADD   tx
  44                    ADD   tx
  45                    ADD   tx
  46            jy      DATA  0        (JMP sf - u)
  47            yrow    ADD   ty
  48                    ADD   ty
  49                    ADD   ty
  50                    ADD   ty
  51                    ADD   ty
  52                    ADD   ty
  53                    ADD   ty
  54                    ADD   ty
  55                    ADD   ty
  56                    ADD   ty
  57            sf      SFT   01
  58            bret    DATA  0
  60            a       DATA  0
  61            b       DATA  0
  62            u       DATA  0
  63            i       DATA  0
  64            k       DATA  0
  65            tx      DATA  0
  66            ty      DATA  0
  67            z       DATA  0
  68            n9      DATA  9
  69            cxr     JMP   xrow
  70            csf     JMP   sf
